title: "Agent memory grows an entity graph: about edges, minted ids, graph-walking recall"
tags: [memory, weave, mcp-ex]
links:
  - label: IxMcp.Memory
    href: https://github.com/indexable-inc/index/blob/main/packages/mcp-ex/lib/ix_mcp/memory.ex
